			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">- Torre de separación T1 (Flash / Condensador):</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">
					<sp count="2"/>* Fondo F4 (líquidos): LK=Acetileno (LK1*f&lt;3&gt;_3), HK=Acetaldehído ((1-HK1)*f&lt;3&gt;_4), Etanol (f&lt;3&gt;_5), Agua (f&lt;3&gt;_6).</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">
					<sp count="2"/>* Tope F5 (gases): Inerte (f&lt;3&gt;_1), Etileno (f&lt;3&gt;_2), LK=Acetileno ((1-LK1)*f&lt;3&gt;_3), HK=Acetaldehído (HK1*f&lt;3&gt;_4).</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="68" left="30" top="3251.25" width="105" height="116.25" align-x="53.25" align-y="3312" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
