				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">D) Matriz de flujos másicos por componente w [g/h] (w_i,j = f_i,j * PM_i):</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="115" left="30" top="5577" width="66" height="18" align-x="53.25" align-y="5586" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
