		<region region-id="132" left="30" top="6332.25" width="650.25" height="36" align-x="30" align-y="6342" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">CONCLUSIÓN DEL BALANCE GLOBAL:</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Como se observa numéricamente, Delta W = 0.000000 g/h y Error = 0.000000 %, lo que demuestra matemáticamente</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">la consistencia estricta de todos los balances de materia por unidad y globales formulados en el sistema.</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="133" left="30" top="6426.75" width="650.25" height="81" align-x="30" align-y="6438" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
				<p style="Heading 2" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">6. ANÁLISIS PARAMÉTRICO EN FUNCIÓN DE LA PURGA GASEOSA BETA_1 (INCISOS B Y C)</p>
				<p style="Heading 2" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Evaluamos la respuesta del proceso ante variaciones en la purga gaseosa beta_1 (desde 0.01 hasta 1.00):</p>
				<p style="Heading 2" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">
					<sp count="2"/>* Caudal de purga gaseosa F6 [mol/h]</p>
				<p style="Heading 2" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">
					<sp count="2"/>* Caudal de alimentación al reactor F2 [mol/h]</p>
				<p style="Heading 2" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">
					<sp count="2"/>* Composición molar de etanol en el producto F13 [% mol]</p>
				<p style="Heading 2" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">
					<sp count="2"/>* Caudal de agua fresca de reposición F14 [mol/h]</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="134" left="30" top="6578.25" width="650.25" height="24" align-x="30" align-y="6588" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">A) Tabla paramétrica para el Inciso B:</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Columnas: [ beta_1,<sp count="2"/>F6 [mol/h],<sp count="2"/>F2 [mol/h],<sp count="2"/>y_etoh_13 [% mol] ]</p>
			</text>
		</region>
